From 9c8520563f0731bd1f8b3c9599f2ba52cab81274 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: John Zila <john@jzila.com>
Date: Sun, 11 Jan 2026 15:49:51 -0600
Subject: [PATCH] test: add resolver flow tests for git-am failure path
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Add comprehensive unit tests for the resolver agent workflow:
- Test resolver spawn when git-am patch application fails
- Test resolver NOT spawned when patch succeeds
- Test IPC child events with parent-child relationship
- Test merge status transitions (pending→acquiring→merging→resolving→merged)
- Test beads status transitions on resolver success/failure
- Test resolver agent ID format and conflict context population
- Test merge slot inheritance during resolver execution
- Test resolver result merge after successful resolution

Also fix orchestrator to pass MergeOptions to MergeSingle call,
using SkipFileFallback when patches are present so resolver handles
conflicts instead of file-based fallback.

